        <item>
            <title>2.6.1</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 12:53:40 +0545</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/kshitijsubedi/nepali-calendar-mac-updates/raw/refs/heads/main/versions/nepali-calendar-mac-2.6.1-41.dmg</link>
            <sparkle:version>41</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.6.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.1</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Appearance
- The System, Light, and Dark themes now all use the native macOS menu material, so the popover matches other menu-bar apps in every mode. The Dark theme drops its old flat gradient for the same frosted look, just pinned to dark.
- Added 'Add Events' on Calendar tab.
- Redesigned Events & Calendar section.       
## Calendar Data Fixes
- Aasoj 2083 now shows 31 days instead of 30. Mangsir, Poush, and Magh 2083 were wrong by a day each in a way that cancelled out, so only Aasoj looked off; all four are corrected.
- Fixed Chaitra in 2095, 2096, and 2097. Chaitra 2096 was two days short, leaving that year with 364 days.
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/kshitijsubedi/nepali-calendar-mac-updates/raw/refs/heads/main/versions/nepali-calendar-mac-2.6.1-41.dmg" length="3261635" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="/IILlKSAAqnTQajQrzP1ZKv9juwswg9AX513fwnpVW6iHLu2NG7AVVJbyTJ8H0/jaKEKK31gRLrVsGiQSYh4Cw=="/>
        </item>
